{"headword":"שָׁלֵם²","parent_lexicon":"BDB Dictionary","content":{"senses":[{"definition":"<strong>adj. complete, safe, at peace</strong>;—<span dir=\"rtl\">שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 15:16\" href=\"/Genesis.15.16\">Gn 15:16</a> +; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁלֵמִים</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 34:21\" href=\"/Genesis.34.21\">Gn 34:21</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nahum 1:12\" href=\"/Nahum.1.12\">Na 1:12</a>; f. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁלֵמָה</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 25:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.25.15\">Dt 25:15</a> +; pl. <span dir=\"rtl\">שְׁלֵמוֹת</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 27:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.27.6\">27:6</a> <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:31\" href=\"/Joshua.8.31\">Jos 8:31</a>;—"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>complete:</em>"},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>full, perfect:</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶבֶן שְׁלֵמָה</span> <em>full weight</em> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 25:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.25.15\">Dt 25:15</a>; <a data-ref=\"Proverbs 11:1\" href=\"/Proverbs.11.1\">Pr 11:1</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵיפָה שׁ׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 25:15\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.25.15\">Dt 25:15</a>; of <span dir=\"rtl\">עָוֹן</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 15:16\" href=\"/Genesis.15.16\">Gn 15:16</a> (JE); number of captives <a data-ref=\"Amos 1:6\" href=\"/Amos.1.6\">Am 1:6</a>, <a data-ref=\"Amos 1:9\" href=\"/Amos.1.9\">9</a>; of army <a data-ref=\"Nahum 1:12\" href=\"/Nahum.1.12\">Na 1:12</a> (text corrupt; 𝔊 <span dir=\"rtl\">משֵׁל מַיִם</span>, but?; v. Comm.); of reward <a data-ref=\"Ruth 2:12\" href=\"/Ruth.2.12\">Ru 2:12</a>; of stones, <em>whole</em> (in natural condition, <em>unhewn</em>) <a data-ref=\"Deuteronomy 27:6\" href=\"/Deuteronomy.27.6\">Dt 27:6</a>; <a data-ref=\"Joshua 8:31\" href=\"/Joshua.8.31\">Jos 8:31</a> (cf. law <a data-ref=\"Exodus 20:22\" href=\"/Exodus.20.22\">Ex 20:25</a>)."}],"num":"a."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>finished:</em> i.e. <em>hewn</em> stones <a data-ref=\"I Kings 6:7\" href=\"/I_Kings.6.7\">1 K 6:7</a>; temple <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 8:16\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.8.16\">2 Ch 8:16</a>."}],"num":"b."}],"num":"1."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>safe, unharmed</em>, of pers. <a data-ref=\"Genesis 33:18\" href=\"/Genesis.33.18\">Gn 33:18</a> (P; Sam. <span dir=\"rtl\">שׁלוֹם</span>, cf. <span dir=\"rtl\">בשׁלום</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 28:21\" href=\"/Genesis.28.21\">28:21</a>; not n.pr.loc. as Vrss)."}],"num":"2."},{"senses":[{"definition":"<em>in covt. of peace</em>, friendship, c. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֵת</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 34:21\" href=\"/Genesis.34.21\">Gn 34:21</a> (P); <span dir=\"rtl\">לֵבָב שָׁלֵם עִם י׳</span> <em>a mind at peace with</em> <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span>, keeping covt. relation, hence <em>complete, perfect</em>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 8:61\" href=\"/I_Kings.8.61\">1 K 8:61</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 11:4\" href=\"/I_Kings.11.4\">11:4</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 15:3\" href=\"/I_Kings.15.3\">15:3</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 15:14\" href=\"/I_Kings.15.14\">14</a>; c. <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל</span> <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 16:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.16.9\">2 Ch 16:9</a>, <span dir=\"rtl\">אֶל</span> om. <a data-ref=\"II Kings 20:3\" href=\"/II_Kings.20.3\">2 K 20:3</a> = <a data-ref=\"Isaiah 38:3\" href=\"/Isaiah.38.3\">Is 38:3</a> <span dir=\"rtl\">(לֵב)</span>, <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 12:38\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.12.38\">1 Ch 12:38</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 29:19\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.29.19\">29:19</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 15:17\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.15.17\">2 Ch 15:17</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 19:9\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.19.9\">19:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 25:2\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.25.2\">25:2</a>; <span dir=\"rtl\">לֵב</span> <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 28:9\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.28.9\">1 Ch 28:9</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 29:9\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.29.9\">29:9</a>."}],"num":"3."}]},"rid":"BDB10269","strong_numbers":["7999","8003","8004"],"next_hw":"שָׁלֵם³","prev_hw":"שָׁלַם","all_cited":true,"ordinal":"I."